  - reliable-change-index
abstract: "Prism is a comprehensive Rust-based tool for processing psychology survey data. It provides automated scale computation with reverse scoring, comprehensive quality checks (missing data, straightlining, pattern detection), statistical analysis (Cronbach's alpha, descriptive statistics), longitudinal analysis with Reliable Change Index (RCI) calculation, and multiple output formats including SPSS syntax, R scripts, Excel, and interactive HTML reports. Designed for researchers in psychology, psychiatry, and social sciences."
